  "usage": {
    "color": "组件使用 var(--nf-color-*)，不内联十六进制颜色。程序窗口表面随 light/dark 模式切换，品牌动作色及选区随 moss/ocean/plum/amber 配色切换；成功、警告、错误与信息等语义色不跟随品牌配色。编辑批注使用 accent，待批准状态使用 warning；只有外层 stage 始终保持 light。",
    "typography": "UI: Inter + Noto Sans SC. Writing: Noto Serif SC. Technical labels: system monospace. Local fonts are copied from the repository's public/fonts into ./fonts for a self-contained preview; missing fonts fall back safely.",
    "spacing": "4px base unit. 16px within groups, 24px between sections, 32-48px page margins. Manuscript line height is intentionally larger than UI line height.",
    "radius": "6px for controls, 10px for cards, 16px for dialogs; pills only for statuses. Do not round every surface into a card.",
    "interaction": "Visible focus ring. 36px desktop targets, 44px compact/touch targets. Respect prefers-reduced-motion. Modal dialogs use browser top layer and restore focus.",
    "background": "背景图片仅在用户主动选择后读取本地 JPEG/PNG/WebP 文件，最大 12 MiB（12 × 1024 × 1024 字节）。通过 Blob URL 在内存中预览，不上传、不持久化；不自动读取本地文件。",
    "window": "HTML 内嵌的 program window 是可交互的程序窗口，不是复制参考样式；窗口内部独立应用模式、配色与背景，外层 stage 始终保持 light。",
    "state": "Generated text is a proposal until explicitly accepted. The prototype stores edits in memory only; navigation preserves drafts, reload resets them. No API calls, filesystem writes or production data access.",
    "migration": "Do not import into src before visual approval. Production integration must preserve CodeMirror undo/selection, project-session guards, dirty/CAS semantics, IPC allowlist and all three locales. Existing plan 25 is not silently superseded by this prototype."
  }
